# The frontend calls /api on the same origin; no VITE_API_URL is needed.
# In development, Vite proxies /api to the existing backend on port 3001.
#
# For the Vercel Functions, configure STRIPE_SECRET_KEY in Vercel.
# CLIENT_URL is optional: when set, it is used for Stripe return URLs.
# Otherwise the function uses the request origin.
# Never put Stripe secret keys in VITE_ variables.
